    "text": "Greensboro\nMajor upgrades are in the works at PTI airport\n2 hours ago\nGREENSBORO, N.C. — Walking through the Piedmont Triad International airport in Greensboro, you'll likely notice two distinct looks. First, there's the ticketing area. \"It's relatively modern,” said Kevin Baker, Executive Director of PTI Airport. “This was updated about ten years ago or so and it feels nice. It's a calm feeling. The lights are nice. It's not frenetic here.\"\n1",
